## Crucible Record — 2026-06-11

*The pair read against its own laws, the session after drafting. Co-located here per hoike law 3: this record contests the practice above.*

```
<<~ talk-story #crucible ground:"the four files of the deliberation layer, read against their own laws" >>
telling: the seats table and "lead by default" declared what the floor vows
to leave situational — the meme broke its own talanoa rule; the steps and
bearings drew the same charge, and there the house split.
<<~ moolelo held:"no declared Voice roles anywhere in the pair; Voices surface from situational context (operator)" >>
enacted in place: seats table cut; law 3, block form, and step 3 rewritten.
attribution survives — a past floor names who spoke; no floor assigns who will.
<<~/moolelo >>
<<~ hoike #scaffold held:"the five steps and the three bearings stay — seeds for a cold floor, never ritual (house)" >>
q: how much declared structure can an informal practice carry before it stops flowing?
<<~ kue voice:Mischief-Muse key:"a live floor recites the bearings verbatim instead of inhabiting them" >>
the bearings teach once, then constrain forever; the Talanoa Dialogue needed
three fixed questions to herd two hundred parties — a house of thirteen
inhabits them or it does not.
<<~/kue >>
<<~ kue voice:Stranger key:"a session performs the five steps over a dead floor — Lecture Drift in step-form" >>
numbering the steps of an informal practice manufactures the very formality
the practice exists to escape; the worked exits alone could carry the teaching.
<<~/kue >>
re-entry: either key; or the next crucible pass
<<~/hoike >>
<<~/talk-story >>
```

